        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to introduce this fantastic 1 bed / 1 bath granny flat to the letting market in Oakwood Grove, Clondalkin, Dublin 22.\nIdeally located within easy reach of Clondalkin Village, the property is close to a host of local shops, schools, restaurants and recreational facilities. There are also excellent transport links nearby with easy access to the N7, M50 and Dublin City Centre.\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious living area, fully fitted kitchen, one double bedroom and main bathroom.\nThis well-presented granny flat offers comfortable and private accommodation. \nViewing is highly advised. Contact RAY COOKE Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 1 bed / 1 bath\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Fitted wardrobes\n- Top quality blinds\n- Own separate entrance\n- Peaceful location\n- Located in the heart of Clondalkin\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
